.TH SYSINFO 1 "November 2026" "sysinfo 0.1" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
sysinfo \- display system information

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sysinfo
[\fB-s\fR]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sysinfo
displays information about the current Linux system.

By default, it displays detailed system information.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -s ", " --short
Display a simplified version with distribution, CPU model and total RAM.

.TP
.BR -h ", " --help
Display help information.

.SH INFORMATION
The full output includes:
.IP \(bu 2
Linux distribution
.IP \(bu 2
Operating system
.IP \(bu 2
Hostname
.IP \(bu 2
CPU model and logical cores
.IP \(bu 2
Total, used and available RAM

.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B sysinfo
Display complete system information.

.TP
.B sysinfo -s
Display simplified system information.

